    {
      "id": 225654,
      "name": "FearLord",
      "username": "FearLord",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/5f8ce5/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-02-20T23:23:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint, but not deserved! Tachyon at 1, everyone else down... I was able to use the incap powers to completely lock the game down and have Tacyhon slowly plink the win (Bunker top decks a card from my trash - Usually Hypersonic Assault, but also grabbed Barrage when I could, Absolute Zero stops the Environment playing a card, Wraith lets me out Luminous Leadership back on top of Dawn’s deck, Tempest lets me draw the card I top decked).</p>\n<p>With nothing else in play, Dawn couldn’t deal damage, plays the same harmless ongoing every turn and the Environment can’t play cards. Tacyhon played Hypersonic Assault every turn and a Barrage when she had it and I stopped drawing when her deck was empty...</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:21.745Z",
