      "raw": "<p>Mint with everyone in their high teens, though they were around 10 at one point. Cleansing Downpour and AZ's normal heal thyself abilities made sure of their recovery. Nothing special here- kill all the citizens except 1 because you never know when a Kraken will pop out. One of THOSE CARDS came out, but I kept a lot of recover from discard cards in my hand knowing it would come up. Infrared Eyepiece helps lock down the villain deck and after that, it was simple to smack Dawn down until she was finished. Having 5 heroes makes Dawn much easier to handle, especially damage dealers like these ones.</p>",
