      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-02-21T02:02:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Nervewracking mint at 5/6/0/0/2.&nbsp; I went completely HAM when the pillars came out and at the end Dawn had 1 HP remaining and killed herself with her own eclipse.&nbsp; I'd honeastly advise skipping Bunker's turn to get rid of the pillars in this fight if you're low on HP and he's not in turret mode (I discarded my turret mode to take care of the grave card, my bad.)&nbsp; Other than that, I took Bolnerap's advise on minion management and everything worked out well..aside from Dawn going crazy after the pillars turn.</p>",
