      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/bc79bd/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-02-23T16:16:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Fairly safe mint for me. I used bolnerap's strategy to keep blood alive and then just made sure there were enough citizens still around so she immediately flipped back when the kraken ate the one. Probably could've played more agressively with wraith, but force of habit made me use infrared + stun bolt combo so it took me a few more rounds.&nbsp;</p>",
